        <field
            name="summary"
        >Yukon rates 6.4%, 9%, 10.9%, 12.8% and 15% from 58,523, 117,045, 181,440 and 500,000; BPAYT = BPAF, 16,452 at most; K4P = the lesser of 0.064 x A* and 0.064 x CEA, CEA 1,501, A* the annual gross employment income; no Yukon labour-sponsored funds credit, surtax or reduction.</field>
        <field name="verified_date">2026-11-12</field>
    </record>
